{"unit_id":"isheng-eqi__dsh-educoder#card-zh","repo":"isheng-eqi/dsh-educoder","commit":"392a88bcb695f8a12ad2b7d76e2ea455105e092f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-educoder 是面向 DSH 的头歌作业工具插件，可通过工具接口扫描课程作业并处理未通过的关卡。它注册作业处理、账号检查和全课程扫描工具，使用头歌 JSON API 读取关卡、提交选择题答案，并在代码题中调用当前会话或指定模型生成文件、上传后获取评测反馈并重试。用户可以先只扫描未完成作业，也可以处理单份作业或检查课程与连接状态。适合需要集中查看或完成头歌练习的 DSH 用户；首次使用需提供头歌账号，代码题需可用的模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:130-175","index.js:178-254","index.js:256-313","lib/flow.js:382-437","lib/flow.js:449-485"]}
{"unit_id":"isheng-eqi__dsh-educoder#card-en","repo":"isheng-eqi/dsh-educoder","commit":"392a88bcb695f8a12ad2b7d76e2ea455105e092f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-educoder is a DSH plugin for EduCoder homework. It scans courses and processes assignments through EduCoder APIs. It submits choice answers and uses a configured or current model to generate and upload code, retrying with grading feedback. An EduCoder account is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:130-175","index.js:178-254","index.js:256-313","lib/flow.js:382-437","lib/flow.js:449-485"]}
